00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:49.480
He said, first, he was in touch with the film commissioner there, Tim Clark.

249
00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:52.840
Randy described him as a fountain of resources.

250
00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:56.600
Tim put Randy in touch with the location manager, Michelle Barone.

251
00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.360
Randy was also in touch with Tim Ruddy.

252
00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:03.580
He was the vice president of marketing for the Maid of the Miss Steamboat Company.

253
00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:07.180
Angela Birdie, the media director of Niagara State Park.

254
00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:10.960
She was a huge fan of the show, and Randy said she helped a lot.

255
00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:15.420
Randy even had to write a proposal to the New York governor's office.

256
00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:20.000
And there was a film liaison there named Pat Kaufman who helped Randy get it all done.

257
00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:25.220
He said this was the nicest group of people, and they just really made it happen.

