00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:27.940
Without them, this scene would not have happened.

259
00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:28.960
Wow.

260
00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:35.220
Well, listen, I have even more stories to tell about our adventures getting on this boat.

