00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:02.760
Yes!

269
00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:04.380
Oh my gosh, this is perfect.

270
00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:09.200
I was just going to say, do you want to remind people what the story was, but you have it.

271
00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:10.200
You have it.

272
00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:11.480
I have it.

273
00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:13.520
I have what we read at the table read.

274
00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:14.840
Oh my God.

