277
00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:23.380
So, in the table draft, Jim and Pam are saying their wedding vows.

278
00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:28.440
Jim is saying, in joy and in sorrow, in sickness and in health, as long as we both shall live,

279
00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.600
