00:24:05.770 --> 00:24:08.290
He must have like done a cartwheel down the hallway.

449
00:24:09.030 --> 00:24:10.570
Like, I can't even imagine.

450
00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:14.850
It did not matter all of the time wasted prepping this.

451
00:24:14.990 --> 00:24:21.490
He was so relieved because he said that freed up the budget so that he could get John and

452
00:24:21.490 --> 00:24:26.310
I to Niagara to actually shoot on Maid of the Mist, which was what he wanted more than

453
00:24:26.310 --> 00:24:26.810
anything.

454
00:24:27.310 --> 00:24:34.330
And so he went back to NBC and he said, listen, if you had the budget for this horse business,

455
00:24:34.330 --> 00:24:39.530
you've got the budget to take these two and let them get married as they should on the

456
00:24:39.530 --> 00:24:42.210
boat with the real falls behind them.

457
00:24:42.430 --> 00:24:45.810
Oh, so this whole storyline gave him leverage as it turns out.

458
00:24:46.010 --> 00:24:46.290
Yes.

459
00:24:46.610 --> 00:24:46.950
In BC.

460
00:24:47.850 --> 00:24:48.350
Completely.

461
00:24:49.450 --> 00:24:55.870
So I hope y'all liked that because I was just like, oh my gosh, all this time, all I was

462
00:24:55.870 --> 00:24:58.130
doing was like trying on different wedding gowns.

463
00:24:58.130 --> 00:25:01.110
And, you know, that was my prep.

464
00:25:01.490 --> 00:25:07.050
It just goes to show how hard our team at the office was always working every week.

465
00:25:07.470 --> 00:25:08.010
Unbelievable.

466
00:25:09.270 --> 00:25:09.750
All right.

